# This project does not require environment variables for the first version.
# Add future service keys here only after the related feature is configured.

# --- Photographer Network membership (Stripe) ---------------------------------
# Not yet configured -- every value below is null until a real Stripe
# account exists. Read from lib/photographer_membership_config.mjs
# (price ids/publishable key) and directly from process.env at the point
# of use (secret key/webhook secret, server-only, never re-exported).
# See docs/DECISIONS.md's "Photographer Network Membership Pricing
# Finalized" entry for exactly what's needed and why.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# STRIPE_PRICE_ID_MONTHLY=
# STRIPE_PRICE_ID_ANNUAL=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
